---
import GlowBackground from "../components/GlowBackground.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <GlowBackground />

  <div
    class="relative flex flex-col items-start max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 pt-24 pb-24 text-sm animate-fade-in w-full"
  >
    <span
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs text-neutral-300 backdrop-blur-sm"
    >
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
      Security
    </span>

    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
      Security policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-neutral-300">
      The security of our users and the trust of our community are taken
      seriously. This page explains how to report a vulnerability and what you
      can expect from us in return.
    </p>

    <section class="mt-12 w-full">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">
        Reporting a vulnerability
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        If you believe you have found a security vulnerability in Applio, its
        website, or its documentation, please report it privately through
        GitHub's private vulnerability reporting. Do
        <strong class="text-white">not</strong> open a public issue or share
        details in public channels before the issue has been addressed.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/IAHispano/Applio/security/advisories/new"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-8 py-3 bg-white text-black font-medium rounded-full hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          Report a vulnerability
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/IAHispano/Applio-Website/security/advisories/new"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-8 py-3 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm text-white font-medium rounded-full hover:bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          Report a website issue
        </a>
      </div>

      <h3 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
        What to include in your report
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        The more context you provide, the faster we can assess the issue. Helpful
        details include:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-neutral-300 text-sm max-w-3xl list-disc list-outside ml-4">
        <li>The Applio version and operating system you are using.</li>
        <li>A description of the vulnerability and the steps to reproduce it.</li>
        <li>The potential impact (e.g. data exposure, privilege escalation).</li>
        <li>Any suggested fix or mitigation, if you have one.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
        What happens next
      </h3>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-neutral-300 text-sm max-w-3xl list-disc list-outside ml-4">
        <li>
          Your report is acknowledged by a maintainer, usually within a few
          days.
        </li>
        <li>
          We investigate the issue and work on a fix, keeping you informed of
          the progress.
        </li>
        <li>
          Once fixed, a patch is released and the vulnerability is disclosed
          responsibly, giving credit to the reporter when appropriate.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 w-full">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">
        Our security posture
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="p-8 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Local-first by design</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Applio runs entirely on your machine. Your audio and models never
            leave your device unless you choose to share them — there is no
            account, no telemetry, and no cloud dependency for core features.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Open and auditable</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            All source code is public and MIT-licensed, so anyone can review it.
            Dependencies are pinned and updated through automated workflows.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Use trusted models</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Your data stays on your machine, but models come from external
            sources. Only use models from sources you trust, verify the
            integrity of files you download, and be careful with models shared
            in public communities.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Keep Applio updated</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            The easiest way to stay secure is to run the latest release. Fixes
            and improvements are released through our regular update channels.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="mt-12 w-full p-8 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl">
      <p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        As with all open source software, Applio is provided "as is" without
        warranty. For details on your rights and responsibilities, see the
        <a href="/terms-use" class="text-white underline decoration-white/30 hover:decoration-white transition-all duration-200"
          >Terms of Use</a
        >, the
        <a
          href="https://github.com/IAHispano/Applio/blob/main/LICENSE"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-white underline decoration-white/30 hover:decoration-white transition-all duration-200"
          >MIT License</a
        >, or reach out on
        <a href="/discord" class="text-white underline decoration-white/30 hover:decoration-white transition-all duration-200"
          >Discord</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>